

# `charly check run` writes its run evidence under .check/<bed>/<calver>/ — GENERATED, never
# committed (the sibling plugin repos carry the same entry for the same reason). A `git add -A`
# at the repo root otherwise sweeps a bed run straight into the commit.
.check/
# `charly box generate`/`build` output — generated, never committed.
.build/
# Generated by `charly box generate`/`build` — never committed.
.dockerignore
.containerignore
